Subject: [PATCH 1/7] kernel-shark-qt: Add plugin infrastructure to be used by the Qt-baset KS.
Date: Tue,  4 Sep 2018 18:52:12 +0300
Message-Id: <20180904155218.32518-2-y.karadz@gmail.com>
In-Reply-To: <20180904155218.32518-1-y.karadz@gmail.com>
